    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1673">

                <pb facs="1323" n="1313" sameAs="frus:frus1949v08/pg1313"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">125.267/8–1249: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chargé in China</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Clark</hi>), <hi rendition="#italic">at Canton</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-08-12T19:00:00-04:00">August 12, 1949—7
                            p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>TelCan 557. Re first para telCan 553, Aug 12, entire ConGen Canton shld be closed
                    whenever in ur and Rankin’s judgment this move desirable prior arrival Commie
                    forces. Make all necessary preparations <pb facs="1324" n="1314" xml:id="pg1314"
                    /> departure personnel who shld proceed first to Hóng Kong. Administrative
                    instructions re closure and future assignment departees, including Rankin, will
                    be subject sep tel. Pls make necessary notification Amer natls.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
